---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout title="About us — QuickBiz" description="Learn about QuickBiz.">
	<Header />
	<main>
		<section class="border-b border-brand/10 bg-gradient-to-b from-page to-surface-subtle py-10 sm:py-14 lg:py-12">
			<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
				<h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand sm:text-4xl">About us</h1>
				<div class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-4xl space-y-4 text-left text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg-muted lg:max-w-5xl">
					<p>
						Quick Bizz was founded in 2018 with a simple idea — to make business funding easier for Australian
						businesses.
					</p>
					<p>
						During early research, we realised that many hardworking business owners were unable to grow as they
						wanted. Not because they lacked potential, but because getting finance was often slow, complicated,
						and confusing.
					</p>
					<p>That’s where the idea of Quick Bizz began.</p>
					<p>
						We set out with a mission to simplify the funding process and help businesses access the financial
						support they need—without unnecessary delays or hassle.
					</p>
					<p>
						Today, Quick Bizz works as an introducer service, connecting Australian businesses with a network of
						trusted lenders. Our goal is to make the process smooth, fast, and easy to understand, so business
						owners can focus on what truly matters—running and growing their business.
					</p>
					<p>
						With the support of our lending partners, many applications are assessed quickly, helping businesses
						move forward without lengthy wait times.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>
